    "pre-convention": "Predates the embedded `## Q&A Transcript` ADR-body convention added to `src/gzkit/templates/adr.md` by commit 99569a63. The design conversation for these ADRs was never recorded as a transcript receipt; authoring a `## Q&A Transcript` section now would fabricate a governance receipt for a conversation that did not happen. Waived under GHI #515 (Finding 1). ADRs authored after the convention landed are NOT exempt and must carry a `## Q&A Transcript` section \u2014 `gz validate --interviews` fails closed for every unwaived ADR."
